</style></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_wrap"><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_heading"><p class="text-size-5xl text-size-3xl--tablet text-size-3xl--mobile text-weight-medium">All your business context in one workspace - a centralized library that brings together your brand details, preferences, and materials to Eve - so nothing gets lost in translation.</p></div><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_content"><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_list"><div id="w-node-_23b47274-98b6-0113-b01e-d89b7ddfa3b3-17d9de49" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card _1"><div id="w-node-_23b47274-98b6-0113-b01e-d89b7ddfa3b4-17d9de49" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-content _1"><h3 class="text-size-3xl opacity-30 hide-tablet">1. Always up to date</h3><p class="text-size-lg text-size-base--tablet">Brain AI stores your brand context, preferences, and materials, <span>so Soshie doesn't "forget" how your business works as things evolve.</span></p></div><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-visual"><img src="/inspiration/images/691d5c5f0bd1e17fb87495d7_illustrations-mobile-1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 973px) 95vw, (max-width: 991px) 925px, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/691d5c5f0bd1e17fb87495d7_illustrations-mobile-1-p-500.png 500w, /inspiration/images/691d5c5f0bd1e17fb87495d7_illustrations-mobile-1.avif 925w" alt="" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-image hide-desktop"><img src="/inspiration/images/691190b52519d79d5f521867_bdc05d463999fc5ec0fcf562bacefdd4_knowledge-card1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 940px, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/691190b52519d79d5f521867_bdc05d463999fc5ec0fcf562bacefdd4_knowledge-card1-p-500.png 500w, /inspiration/images/691190b52519d79d5f521867_bdc05d463999fc5ec0fcf562bacefdd4_knowledge-card1.avif 1068w" alt="" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-image hide-tablet"></div></div><div id="w-node-_23b47274-98b6-0113-b01e-d89b7ddfa3c9-17d9de49" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card _2"><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-content _2"><h3 class="text-size-3xl opacity-30 hide-tablet">2. Context that compounds</h3><p class="text-size-lg text-size-base--tablet">As you refine strategy, approve content, and ship updates, <span>Brain AI keeps everything connected - no re-explaining, no resets.</span></p></div><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-visual _2"><img src="/inspiration/images/691d5c5fecd5037c19cf012d_illustrations-mobile.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 95vw, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/691d5c5fecd5037c19cf012d_illustrations-mobile-p-500.png 500w, /inspiration/images/691d5c5fecd5037c19cf012d_illustrations-mobile.avif 1195w" alt="" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-image _2 hide-desktop"><img src="/inspiration/images/6911918a206f64ecee2416de_knowledge-card-2.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 940px, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/6911918a206f64ecee2416de_knowledge-card-2-p-500.avif 500w, /inspiration/images/6911918a206f64ecee2416de_knowledge-card-2.avif 1361w" alt="" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-image _2 hide-tablet"></div></div><div id="w-node-_23b47274-98b6-0113-b01e-d89b7ddfa3be-17d9de49" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card"><div id="w-node-_23b47274-98b6-0113-b01e-d89b7ddfa3bf-17d9de49" class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-content _3"><h3 class="text-size-3xl opacity-30 hide-tablet">3. One source of truth</h3><p class="text-size-lg text-size-base--tablet">Your strategy, voice, and references live in one place, <span>ensuring consistency across every post, campaign, and channel.</span></p></div><div class="helper-lp-knowledge_card-visual"><img src="/inspiration/images/691d5c5f6f82c60963ee9e07_illustrations-mobile-2.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 95vw, 100vw" srcset="/inspiration/images/691d5c5f6f82c60963ee9e07_illustrations-mobile-2-p-500.avif 500w, /inspiration/images/691d5c5f6f82c6